WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Welcome to the PrepFord NCLEX-PN pathway, designed for Practical and Vocational Nursing (LPN/LVN) candidates.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
Sign into your PrepFord account to access your dedicated PN Learner Dashboard.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
Review your PN workspace, coordinated care progress, and available practical nursing examinations.

00:26.000 --> 00:36.000
Open the PN question bank and select a practical nursing practice examination.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Evaluate the practical nursing clinical scenario, patient observations, and bedside vital signs before choosing your answer.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Submit your response to review the correct nursing action and option-by-option distractor rationales.

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
Review relevant nursing notes in the Study Guide and check your PN domain performance information.

01:12.000 --> 01:25.000
Begin your NCLEX-PN preparation with confidence in the PrepFord PN Learner Dashboard.
